{{!
    @template mod_these/actions

    Liens rendus en boutons. Sur une ligne, sans saut de ligne final : un espace entre deux boutons
    en ligne se verrait.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * actions Boutons : label, url, class.

    Example context (json):
    {"actions": [
        {"label": "Modifier le dossier", "url": "https://example.com/mod/these/edit.php?id=2&dossierid=3",
            "class": "btn btn-primary mr-1 mb-1"},
        {"label": "Suivi des signatures", "url": "https://example.com/mod/these/signatures.php?id=2&dossierid=3",
            "class": "btn btn-primary mr-1 mb-1"}
    ]}
}}
{{#actions}}<a href="{{url}}" class="{{class}}">{{label}}</a>{{/actions}}